# Copy to .env and fill in. Secrets never live in the repo (ARCHITECTURE.md §9).
#
# The rebuild retired most of what used to be here (ADR-0006): the bearer token, the API and client
# ports, the single server-side SQLite path and the deploy env are all gone. The vault is one file in
# the app sandbox, and the AI key is **the user's**, in the platform secure store, entered in the app
# — never an env var and never a repository secret (§5, NFR-PRIV1).

# --- AI provider (ARCHITECTURE.md §5; ADR-0003 amended) ---
# The model the provider adapter defaults to. The key is not here: the app reads it from the secure
# store at run time, per user.
AI_MODEL=

# --- CI evidence only (ARCHITECTURE.md §5, §11; issue EV6) ---
# OpenRouter's own ZDR-classified endpoint list — the provider's path, not ours.
ZDR_ENDPOINTS_URL=https://openrouter.ai/api/v1/endpoints/zdr
